  <trk>
    <name>Montesa to Enguera - Wikiloc</name>
    <cmt>During the track maintenance works, Montesa can be reached from Xàtiva. 
 
At the beginning of the route, you can visit the local castle, although it was closed during our trip. 
 
Until the turn towards Enguera, the route follows a major road. After that, the trail begins, with a couple of steep sections. 
 
In Enguera, it's worth buying some food before heading back. Climb up to the Castle of Enguera, where you can enjoy your meal sitting on a rock while taking in the views. Then, follow the same route back to Montesa. 
 
If you arrive early, there are plenty of convenient picnic tables near the castle.</cmt>
    <desc>During the track maintenance works, Montesa can be reached from Xàtiva. 
 
At the beginning of the route, you can visit the local castle, although it was closed during our trip. 
 
Until the turn towards Enguera, the route follows a major road. After that, the trail begins, with a couple of steep sections. 
 
In Enguera, it's worth buying some food before heading back. Climb up to the Castle of Enguera, where you can enjoy your meal sitting on a rock while taking in the views. Then, follow the same route back to Montesa. 
 
If you arrive early, there are plenty of convenient picnic tables near the castle.</desc>
